---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const lastUpdatedDate = 'August 15, 2026';
const contactEmail = 'kshreyash004@gmail.com';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | WCE CGPA to Percentage Converter"
  description="Privacy Policy for WCE CGPA to Percentage Converter - how we handle your data."
>
  <div class="space-y-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 font-sans">
    
    <!-- Page Header -->
    <div class="pb-4 border-b border-binance-border space-y-1.5">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
        <div class="text-xs text-binance-yellow font-mono font-medium uppercase tracking-wider">
          Data Privacy & Client-Side Execution Guarantee
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs text-binance-muted font-mono">
          Last updated: {lastUpdatedDate}
        </div>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-binance-muted text-xs sm:text-sm max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        How WCE CGPA to Percentage Converter handles user privacy and browser data storage.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content Sections -->
    <div class="bg-binance-card rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-binance-border space-y-6 text-binance-text text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed binance-glow-card">
      
      <!-- Section 1: Zero Backend & Client-Side Execution -->
      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-binance-yellow shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
            <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path>
          </svg>
          <span>1. Client-Side Execution & Zero Backend Server</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-binance-muted leading-relaxed">
          <strong>WCE CGPA to Percentage Converter</strong> operates as a 100% client-side web application. All calculations (including CGPA to percentage conversions, SGPA computations, and attendance penalty evaluations) are executed entirely inside your browser. No data, inputs, or calculation results are ever transmitted to or stored on an external backend server or database.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2: Browser LocalStorage Usage -->
      <section class="space-y-2 pt-4 border-t border-binance-border">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-binance-yellow shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"></ellipse>
            <path d="M21 12c0 1.66-4 3-9 3s-9-1.34-9-3"></path>
            <path d="M3 5v14c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3V5"></path>
          </svg>
          <span>2. Local Browser Storage (localStorage)</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-binance-muted leading-relaxed">
          To enhance your user experience, this application uses your browser's standard <code class="font-mono bg-binance-canvas px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-binance-border text-binance-yellow">localStorage</code> for two specific features:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-binance-muted">
          <li><strong class="text-white">Calculation History:</strong> Temporarily saving past calculations locally on your device if you click "Save".</li>
          <li><strong class="text-white">Theme Preference:</strong> Remembering your Dark or Light theme choice across page visits.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-xs text-binance-muted/70 italic pt-1">
          This data remains strictly on your personal device and is never sent across any network. You can clear this data at any time via your browser settings or by clicking "Clear History" in the application.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3: Personal Information -->
      <section class="space-y-2 pt-4 border-t border-binance-border">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-binance-yellow shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M17.94 17.94A10.07 10.07 0 0 1 12 20c-7 0-11-8-11-8a18.45 18.45 0 0 1 5.06-5.94M9.9 4.24A9.12 9.12 0 0 1 12 4c7 0 11 8 11 8a18.5 18.5 0 0 1-2.16 3.19m-6.72-1.07a3 3 0 1 1-4.24-4.24"></path>
            <line x1="1" y1="1" x2="23" y2="23"></line>
          </svg>
          <span>3. No Personal Data Collection</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-binance-muted leading-relaxed">
          No personally identifiable information (such as your name, email address, student PRN number, or IP logs) is requested, collected, stored, or shared by this site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4: Anonymous Visitor Counter -->
      <section class="space-y-2 pt-4 border-t border-binance-border">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-binance-yellow shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
            <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
            <path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path>
            <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path>
          </svg>
          <span>4. Anonymous Visitor Counter</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-binance-muted leading-relaxed">
          The site includes a live visitor counter that makes an anonymous API call to an internal Vercel serverless function backed by an Upstash Redis database, solely to maintain an aggregated total visitor count.
        </p>
        <p class="text-binance-muted leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="text-white">Strict Privacy Guarantee:</strong> No IP addresses, no cookies, and no personally identifiable information (PII) are collected, logged, or stored. The system only stores an anonymous <code class="font-mono bg-binance-canvas px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-binance-border text-binance-yellow">wce_visitor_counted</code> boolean flag in your browser's <code class="font-mono bg-binance-canvas px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-binance-border text-binance-yellow">localStorage</code> to prevent duplicate counts, alongside a single aggregate integer counter on the server.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5: Privacy Contact -->
      <section class="space-y-2 pt-4 border-t border-binance-border">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-binance-yellow shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
            <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
          </svg>
          <span>5. Contact Information</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-binance-muted leading-relaxed">
          If you have any questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us via email at:{' '}
          <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`} class="font-mono text-binance-yellow underline hover:text-binance-yellow-hover break-all font-semibold">
            {contactEmail}
          </a>
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
